{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>昨晚（30日）10時許，警方接獲途人報案，一名疑飲醉酒的外籍男子，在佐敦廟街190號一間酒吧一帶徘徊，懷疑持有武器。衝鋒隊帶齊裝備接報到場，在酒吧鄰近唐樓樓梯口截獲該名男子，檢獲仿製曲尺手槍，並以涉嫌「管有仿製槍械」罪名作出拘捕。</p><p>據了解，被捕男子年約46歲，來自澳洲。</p><p>就現場所見，疑犯黑布蒙頭，被帶上警車，警方在場調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"疑犯黑布蒙頭，被帶上警車。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182120028896497664682495.jpeg/c_v14rOh-XmtfwJeoSaTVKDR2wJBbfzEmzeuR6E3rkc\"/><figcaption>疑犯黑布蒙頭，被帶上警車。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方到場調查。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182120032256266240370429.jpeg/L7F53ZXA9ZiE3lCbSUrwckMv9qW12AeO1VYgbO9WIGw\"/><figcaption>警方到場調查。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方到場調查。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182120584784646144195407.jpeg/u-5nhtgBdgwizroKSWu4-9d7JIs91hgKn0onhqVKJ4Y\"/><figcaption>警方到場調查。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方到場調查。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182120580510519296980265.jpeg/1zmtx8vqbVB6dfVf9GZ5sMveQHrD3EWKuRWzKoMVsyo\"/><figcaption>警方到場調查。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方到場調查。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182120576811012096371628.jpeg/YaY6vCd1WRmGhdjxKM3X1ABVuE_1F6Xd_u2YS8TtmEs\"/><figcaption>警方到場調查。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T16:19:16.482613+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":238,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}